<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ cuts NZ one and three year fixed home rates.</title>
<headline>ANZ cuts NZ one and three year fixed home rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ and PostBank said on Thursday they would cut their New Zealand one year fixed mortgage rate to 9.95 percent from 10.25 percent, and their three year fixed mortgage rate to 9.25 percent from 9.50 percent, effective November 8.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
